 "preferred_name": "Group decision-making",
 "kind": "method",
 "definition": "A process in which a group weighs the options together and reaches a decision.",
 "description": {
  "text": "A situation in which individuals collectively choose from alternatives, so the decision can no longer be attributed to any single member. Social influence and group processes contribute to the outcome. It is also called collaborative or collective decision-making.",
